cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Product Questionbook"
message: "If you use this framework, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A reusable, evidence-bound question framework for designing, reviewing, and
  improving software products across the whole lifecycle. Questions form a typed
  activation graph with stable identifiers; a run produces a versioned decision and
  assurance package ending in a single gate result.
